11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo</link><description>Anthropic PBC 的股价攀升至 83 美元以上的首次公开募股价格之上，这家人工智能实验室希望以积极的表现结束创纪录的首次亮相后在纳斯达克的首个日历周。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo'&gt;首次公开募股以来，经历了一周的波动后，Anthropic 股价大幅上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Shares Jump After Volatile First Week Since IPO&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:49:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚对帝国啤酒的兴趣可能也会影响其百威英博股份</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake</link><description>一项可能重塑全球烟草业的三方协议也可能波及另一个其产品有时与香烟一起消费的行业——啤酒。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake'&gt;奥驰亚对帝国啤酒的兴趣可能也会影响其百威英博股份&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria’s Interest in Imperial May Affect Its AB InBev Stake&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:14:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>香港正在出卖这座曾经的城市</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/hong-kong-is-selling-the-city-it-used-to-be-video</link><description>香港正在将怀旧变成一个蓬勃发展的产业。从时代犯罪剧到电影场景的旅游景点，当地人抓住机会逃离 20 世纪 80 年代和 90 年代。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/hong-kong-is-selling-the-city-it-used-to-be-video'&gt;香港正在出卖这座曾经的城市&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hong Kong Is Selling The City It Used To Be&lt;/small&gt;</description>